{"id":97944396103779,"type":"artist","name":"His Name Is Alive","artist":null,"year":1986,"weight":13,"info":{"tags":["dream pop","experimental","4ad","indie","ethereal"],"country":"US","begin":"1986","kind":"Group","similar":["This Mortal Coil","Lisa Germano","Love Spirals Downwards","A.R. Kane","Cranes","Soul Whirling Somewhere","Kitchens of Distinction","Dif Juz","Pram","Pale Saints"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/His_Name_is_Alive.jpg?width=500","bio":"His Name Is Alive es el proyecto del multi instrumentista y arreglista Warren Defevre. En un inicio formado por Defevre, la vocalista Karin Oliver y el baterista Demian Lang, compañeros de la universidad y originarios de Livonia, Michigan. \nCon esta alineción graban un demotape que llego hasta las manos del productor Inglés, Ivo Watts-Russell, que de inmediato los firma para su sello 4AD donde realizan en 1990 su primer album, Livonia. En este"},"works":[{"id":1713237803181,"type":"album","name":"Livonia","artist":"His Name Is Alive","year":1990,"weight":11,"yt":"c9m96JWgma4","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":762,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":5600781599810,"type":"album","name":"Love Can't Buy Happiness","artist":"His Name Is Alive","year":1990,"weight":12,"yt":"IzIrUszUEqs","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":22478217896300,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Experimental Rock","rank":90,"scaruffi":null},{"id":46410313403407,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Rock","rank":56,"scaruffi":null},{"id":114554236241704,"name":"RYM Top — Psychedelia — Neo-Psychedelia","rank":89,"scaruffi":null},{"id":150848509715573,"name":"RYM Top — Experimental","rank":93,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":6}},{"id":270023456925504,"type":"album","name":"Home Is in Your Head","artist":"His Name Is Alive","year":1991,"weight":